cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Labour informality among private-sector employees in Peru: ENAHO, 2018-2022"
abstract: >-
  Stata code that merges the modules of Peru's national household survey
  (ENAHO, INEI) for 2018-2022, builds labour market variables, produces
  survey-weighted descriptive tables and estimates logit models of labour
  informality among private-sector employees, with average marginal effects.
authors:
